いると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.061.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_061_操夢.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"characterName":"操夢","slideTitle":"第61スライド","voiceDuration":8.73,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_062_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","seName":"[SE] 衣擦れ1.mp3","id":"893ECDE4-DC30-4477-8E97-BAB95B93CDD0","seVolume":0.85,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 62","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","showTelopOverlay":false,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","characterName":"操夢","slideTitle":"第62スライド","telop":"僕は、彼女の頭をそっと撫でながら、液体の作用を思い返す。\n実は、さっきの説明には欠けている箇所があった。","duration":8.044126984126985,"animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.7,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.062.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.044126984126985},{"showTelopOverlay":false,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.677823129251701,"id":"B5907802-32DA-4377-BD0E-5861F5CB1408","seStartTimeOffset":-8.04412698412699,"title":"シーン 63","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_063_操夢.wav","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","seName":"[SE] 衣擦れ1.mp3","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.063.jpeg","slideTitle":"第63スライド","voiceDuration":8.677823129251701,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","seVolume":0.85,"bgmVolume":0.7,"backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","telop":"一つは、その液体の真の狙い、もう一つはアルコールとの相互作用である。真の狙いは、彼女のように、いろいろ出し切ること。","characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし"},{"showTelopOverlay":false,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.571292517006803,"id":"6DC07541-04C7-4D2C-B4E7-C27DAA77A5B8","seStartTimeOffset":-16.721950113378682,"title":"シーン 64","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_064_操夢.wav","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","seName":"[SE] 衣擦れ1.mp3","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.064.jpeg","slideTitle":"第64スライド","voiceDuration":8.571292517006803,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","seVolume":0.85,"bgmVolume":0.7,"backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","telop":"歳を重ねるとともに、窮屈になり、閉じていくその思考回路を一時的に、弱らせて、心の中にある内容を全て聞き出す。","characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし"},{"showTelopOverlay":false,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.832154195011338,"id":"3DDBE601-9C71-437B-8887-DB3333C0316A","seStartTimeOffset":-25.293242630385464,"title":"シーン 65","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_操夢.wav","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","seName":"[SE] 衣擦れ1.mp3","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.065.jpeg","slideTitle":"第65スライド","voiceDuration":8.832154195011338,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","seVolume":0.85,"bgmVolume":0.7,"backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","telop":"そして、後半には、液体にアルコールも混ぜて、その液体が作用している間の記憶や話した内容を吹き飛ばす。これが真の狙い。","characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし"},{"showTelopOverlay":false,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.175646258503402,"id":"CF29F7A2-9398-435B-8B10-63BD1DFFD8DE","seStartTimeOffset":-34.12539682539682,"title":"シーン 66","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_操夢.wav","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","seName":"[SE] 衣擦れ1.mp3","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.066.jpeg","slideTitle":"第66スライド","voiceDuration":8.175646258503402,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","seVolume":0.85,"bgmVolume":0.7,"backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","telop":"そして、これは二つ目のアルコールとの相互作用である。まぁ、簡潔に言えば、お酒の力でよりいろいろ消し飛ばす作用である。","characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし"},{"showTelopOverlay":false,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.044126984126984,"id":"FD7C8683-D527-4CE0-85B0-219CC18FB4A7","seStartTimeOffset":-42.3010430839002,"title":"シーン 67","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_067_操夢.wav","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","seName":"[SE] 衣擦れ1.mp3","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.067.jpeg","slideTitle":"第67スライド","voiceDuration":7.044126984126984,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","seVolume":0.85,"bgmVolume":0.7,"backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","telop":"かと言って、飲み過ぎれば、言動や行動が幼児退行してしまうので、そこだけは注意をしないといけないけれど…。","characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし"},{"voiceDuration":7.813673469387755,"transitionName":"なし","seVolume":0.85,"seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/衣擦れ1.mp3","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.068.jpeg","seName":"[SE] 衣擦れ1.mp3","showTelopOverlay":false,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"そんなことを考えながら、ふと時計を見る。時計を見ると、午後3時だった。「そろそろ、アリスさんを起こそうかな…」","backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","characterName":"操夢","slideTitle":"第68スライド","title":"シーン 68","duration":7.813673469387755,"bgmVolume":0.7,"animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_068_操夢.wav","seStartTimeOffset":-49.34517006802719,"id":"E427FD28-D1B3-4413-BB45-7781944CF168"},{"id":"3B06C50F-55D2-4958-AFA8-E5D88AAF6D2D","title":"シーン 69","backgroundName":"5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/5296ED2E-3516-5D38-AACC-F50CB132CE91.jpg","telop":"「アリスさん、起きてください、じゃない夜眠れませんよ。」\n僕はそう言いながら、彼女の肩を叩く。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","duration":6.747369614512472,"seVolume":1,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り寝顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.7,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a\/社会人の日常__第2話_〜彼が研究室で作業をしていると上海が来て___〜_e1300b801a.069.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_069_操夢.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"showTelopOverlay":false,"characterName":"操夢"